cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this survey or repository, please cite it as below."
title: "Deepfake Detection Beyond the Lab: A Survey of Real-World Distribution, Forensics, and Provenance"
abstract: >-
  A survey of 239 works on generative audio-video deepfakes across the full
  lifecycle of creation, platform distribution, detection, provenance, and
  remediation, organized around five forensic assumptions (A1-A5) that
  detectors implicitly rely on.
